From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Priestley <Voicedrew11@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 11:42:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] Add opt-in GS diagnostics with env-gated tracing

- PS2X_GS_TRACE: text trace of GS activity (register writes, image transfers, draw primitives)
- PS2X_GS_TRACE_FROM/TO: vsync tick range for filtering trace output
- PS2X_VRAM_DUMP: raw 4 MB GS local memory dump on shutdown

Implements gs_trace.h/.cpp with buffered file output, hooks in:
- gs_frontend.cpp: register writes and draw primitives
- gs_cpu_backend.cpp: image transfer tracking
- ps2_runtime.cpp: vsync tick markers and shutdown VRAM dump

Trace output verified working: includes register values with decoded fields,
image transfer details, and primitive draw information with vsync markers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
